                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "The Good Pencil",
                                  "Dot's notebook\nbegins with tiny\nletters and long\napologies. Later",
                                  "pages have larger\ndiagrams and fewer\napologies. The\nlast margin",
                                  "says: I can be\ncareful and still\nspeak first. She\nhas drawn a small",
                                  "square around the\nsentence, as if\ngiving herself a\nbadge."
                                ],
