                                    "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                                    "args": {
                                      "text": [
                                        "With the needle\nfreed, OFF reads\nZERO. ON fills the\nbucket to TWO\nmarks, and the",
                                        "gauge agrees. Dot\nsigns the test\nherself. Pip\noffers a gold\nstar. She accepts",
                                        "a second witness\nsignature instead,\nthen asks for the\nstar as well."
                                      ],
