                                          "args": {
                                            "text": [
                                              "Dot checks the\nbucket record\nagainst the\nturbine plate.\nFOUR remains the",
                                              "safe service\nlimit. She signs\nthe card and asks\nRivet to witness\nit. Slush watches",
                                              "the two signatures\nand asks where to\nput his. Dot gives\nhim the copy\nreceipt."
